Bun was added in '''Beta 7.6''', as a 1/1/1 summon for Bunbun with a Dust effect of giving +4 ATK to all Bunbuns on your board. While it started out with a cost of 1G, like [[Gift Bear|Gift]], this was changed to 0G undocumented. (In Bun's case, this was most likely done during '''Beta 14.0''' when Bunbun was buffed.)

'''Beta 17.0''' nerfed its effect and will now only give +4 ATK to a single random ally Bunbun. '''Beta 43.1''' buffed its effect, reverting it to its previous state. '''Beta 57.0''' nerfed its effect again, this time by only giving +3 ATK.
